("Rings of the Warding Bond", "Ring", "Uncommon", None, "These two silver rings come as a pair. Once per dawn, while two creatures each wear one of them and are within 60 feet of each other, either wearer can take a Magic action to cast Warding Bond from the ring on the other wearer, without material components."),
