("Ring of Mist", "Ring", "Rare", A, "Once per dawn, you can cast Gaseous Form from this ring, targeting only yourself. While you are in gaseous form, you can end the effect as a Bonus Action."),
("Ring of Living Stone", "Ring", "Very Rare", A, "While wearing this ring, you have Tremorsense with a range of 30 feet. Once per dawn, you can cast Stoneskin from it, targeting only yourself and without material components. The spell doesn't require Concentration."),
("Ring of the Seeming Crowd", "Ring", "Very Rare", A, "Once per dawn, you can cast Seeming (save DC 17) from this ring."),
