("Staff of the Faithful Hound", "Staff", "Rare", AS, "This staff can be wielded as a Quarterstaff. It has 7 charges and regains 1d6 + 1 expended charges daily at dawn. While holding it, you can expend 2 charges to cast Magic Mouth from it, or 4 charges to cast Faithful Hound from it. Neither spell needs material components."),
("Staff of Lights and Shadows", "Staff", "Rare", AS, "This staff can be wielded as a Quarterstaff. It has 7 charges and regains 1d6 + 1 expended charges daily at dawn. While holding it, you can expend charges to cast one of the following spells from it (save DC 15): Silent Image (1 charge), Phantasmal Force (2 charges), or Hallucinatory Terrain (4 charges)."),
