("Staff of the Blade Storm", "Staff", "Legendary", AS, "This staff is a magic Quarterstaff that grants a +3 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with it. It has 20 charges and regains 2d8 + 4 expended charges daily at dawn. While holding it, you can expend charges to cast one of the following spells from it (save DC 18, +10 to hit): Spiritual Weapon (2 charges), Blade Barrier (6 charges), or Arcane Sword (7 charges)."),
("Staff of Earth's Fury", "Staff", "Legendary", AS, "This staff of dark granite is a magic Quarterstaff that grants a +3 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with it. While holding it, you can't be knocked Prone. It has 20 charges and regains 2d8 + 4 expended charges daily at dawn. You can expend charges to cast one of the following spells from it (save DC 18): Meld into Stone (3 charges), Wall of Stone (5 charges), or Earthquake (8 charges)."),
# ================= SCROLLS =================
("Scroll of the Secret Ink", "Scroll", "Common", None, "Write a message of up to one page on this scroll and name up to three creatures. For 10 days, the writing looks like a harmless letter or a shopping list to everyone except the named creatures."),
("Scroll of Gentle Repose", "Scroll", "Uncommon", None, "As a Magic action, you read this scroll and touch a corpse. For 10 days, the corpse can't decay and can't become Undead, and those days don't count toward the time limit of a spell that returns it to life. The scroll then turns to dust."),
("Scroll of the Floating Disk", "Scroll", "Uncommon", None, "As a Magic action, you read this scroll aloud to cast Floating Disk. The disk lasts for 24 hours instead of 1 hour, and it can carry up to 1,000 pounds. The scroll then turns to dust."),
